    <briefdescription>
<para>Knowledge graph enricher for training samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enriches training samples by traversing the knowledge graph to find:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Related legal provisions (cross-references)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Relevant case law precedents</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Internal administrative guidance</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Semantically similar documents</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The enriched context improves training quality by providing additional semantic information about each training sample.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">EnrichmentConfig<sp/>config;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.target_collection<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;legal_training_samples&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.graph_name<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;legal_knowledge_graph&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.max_related_items<sp/>=<sp/>5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.traversal_depth<sp/>=<sp/>2;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_knowledge_graph_enricher_1ace9b657d4d5bf2f956c2489287b15331" kindref="member">KnowledgeGraphEnricher</ref><sp/>enricher(config,<sp/>db);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>stats<sp/>=<sp/>enricher.enrichAll();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Enriched<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>stats.samples_enriched<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;<sp/>samples\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
